        "shell": "/usr/bin/osascript -l JavaScript -e 'var s = $.NSUserDefaults.alloc.initWithSuiteName(\"com.apple.assistant.support\"); var v = ObjC.unwrap(s.objectForKey(\"Search Queries Data Sharing Status\")); (v == 2 && s.objectIsForcedForKey(\"Search Queries Data Sharing Status\")) ? \"PASS\" : \"FAIL\"'"
